body	O	ac9f5341	## 책임\r\n사양 파일을 연 뒤에만 얻는 맥락. 쓰는 쪽(ContextWriteSide) 과 읽는 쪽(ContextReadSide) 을 내주고, 여러 흐름을 잇는 상위 흐름(체크포인트 확정)을 둔다 (CR-002 · CR-006, 개발수칙 6.1 · 6.5).\r\n\r\n타입: ContextWriteSide, ContextReadSide, OpenedContext\r\n\r\n## 모듈 인터페이스\r\n```cpp\r\n// class ContextWriteSide\r\nContextWriteSide(Editor& editor, RelationEditor& relation_editor, Lifecycle& lifecycle, Checker& checker);\r\nEditor& editor() const;\r\nRelationEditor& relationEditor() const;\r\nLifecycle& lifecycle() const;\r\nKiottySpecStatus completeCheckpoint(entity::Actor actor) const;\r\n// class ContextReadSide\r\nContextReadSide(const ModelCatalog& catalog, Finder& finder, Differ& differ, CursorPool& cursors);\r\nconst ModelCatalog& catalog() const;\r\nFinder& finder() const;\r\nDiffer& differ() const;\r\nCursorPool& cursors() const;\r\n// class OpenedContext\r\nOpenedContext(Workspace& workspace, const ContextWriteSide& write_side, const ContextReadSide& read_side, const SystemPath& root);\r\nOpenedContext(const OpenedContext&) = delete;\r\nOpenedContext& operator=(const OpenedContext&) = delete;\r\nKiottySpecStatus initialize(Span<const char> name);\r\nentity::Failure& failure();\r\nWorkspace& workspace();\r\nContextWriteSide writeSide() const;\r\nContextReadSide readSide() const;\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 멤버 변수\r\n```cpp\r\n// ContextWriteSide\r\nEditor& _editor;\r\nRelationEditor& _relation_editor;\r\nLifecycle& _lifecycle;\r\nChecker& _checker;\r\n// ContextReadSide\r\nconst ModelCatalog& _catalog;\r\nFinder& _finder;\r\nDiffer& _differ;\r\nCursorPool& _cursors;\r\n// OpenedContext\r\nContextWriteSide _write_side;\r\nContextReadSide _read_side;\r\nWorkspace& _workspace;\r\nconst SystemPath& _root;\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 의존 모듈\r\n- DSN-075 CursorPool\r\n- DSN-078 Differ\r\n- DSN-079 Finder\r\n- DSN-032 Span\r\n- DSN-041 FileSystem\r\n- DSN-022 Failure\r\n- DSN-062 Checker\r\n- DSN-063 Editor\r\n- DSN-064 Lifecycle\r\n- DSN-065 ModelCatalog\r\n- DSN-067 RelationEditor\r\n- DSN-072 Workspace\r\n\n## 변경 예정 (CR-015)\n- ContextWriteSide 에 remote() (RemoteState&), ruleAcceptor(), ruleExporter() 를 더한다 (public 7 개 이하).\n- ContextReadSide 에 ruleDiffer() 를 더한다.\n
